"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in master and latest official builds too.\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.dev (64b09905c) - macOS Sequoia (15.4.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDragging a selection from one LineEdit to another one shows the caret to help visualise where the selection will be dropped. However when the drag and drop operation is aborted the unfocused LineEdit will still display the caret.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1a60f1a8-a919-4d3a-b665-5a2405ae303c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create two LineEdit nodes\n2. Select some text from one LineEdit\n3. Drag it to the other one without dropping\n4. Drop the selection outside to cancel it\n5. Caret still shows in the second LineEdit\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[line_edit_drag_drop_selection_2025-06-02_17-29-10.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20554407/line_edit_drag_drop_selection_2025-06-02_17-29-10.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.co